@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000/api

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ HTTP/1.1

### Listar todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/items

### Obtener uno (reemplazar el id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/id

### Crear
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Ejemplo 1",
    "descripcion": "Dato de prueba"
}

### Actualizar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/items/id
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Ejemplo modificado"
}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/items/id